  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-12-28T01:51:52.286Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently in version 3.5.0 of the Unity 2022 SDK for avatars, when you unlink the eyes of your model to set individual offsets, for whatever reason, when they're uploaded, the values between the left and right eyes are swapped\n\nThe issue can be bypassed by deliberately swapping the left and right values, as you can see I've done below. The eyes appear incorrect in the SDK, but once uploaded they appear correct. As you can imagine, the opposite happens otherwise",
